cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, cite it with this metadata and the commit you used."
type: dataset
title: "vocabmod-se: a structured resource for Swedish health-data terminologies and cross-system mappings"
authors:
  - family-names: "Aldén"
    given-names: "Ludvig"
    email: "vocabmod-se@ludvigalden.com"
contact:
  - family-names: "Aldén"
    given-names: "Ludvig"
    email: "vocabmod-se@ludvigalden.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ludvigalden/vocabmod-se"
url: "https://github.com/ludvigalden/vocabmod-se"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Swedish health-data code systems and 110,101 mappings to international
  reference terminologies and OMOP concepts, as plain-text KDL documents
  checked against one schema. Every mapping carries a confidence tier or
  a named reason why none could be assigned; no expert or agency has
  reviewed the mappings.
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
keywords:
  - terminology
  - Swedish health data
  - OMOP
  - SNOMED CT
  - KDL
